<title>GERMANY: VW says sees positive development in 1997.</title>
<headline>VW says sees positive development in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>WOLFSBURG, Germany 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Volkswagen AG on Wednesday forecast that its business would continue to develop positively in 1997 even given a conservative assessment of economic growth and exchange rate developments.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it expected sales to increase, contrasting with the overall market trend due to the launch of new models.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 756525</p>
</text>
